 "2247", "creator_uid": 5148, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1582967894", "length": 10}, {"id": 5193, "uuid": "9da9d486-fe09-43f2-bd84-1b2be2d66921", "hitokoto": "哪有什么岁月静好，不过是有人在替你负重前行。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "Aldrich", "creator_uid": 5178, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1583204771", "length": 22}, {"id": 5195, "uuid": "760a4385-1586-4555-b4dc-7d7455c6f1d8", "hitokoto": "“对方正在输入中”，给了多少人希望，又让多少人绝望。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "网络", "creator": "Polaris", "creator_uid": 5204, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1583217765", "length": 26}, {"id": 5219, "uuid": "f0421921-1294-4f8a-8eb7-8cbe8fc55360", "hitokoto": "水的清澈，并非因为它不含杂质，而是在于懂得沉淀。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "qwqbear", "creator_uid": 3516, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1583661311", "length": 24}, {"id": 5222, "uuid": "a550694a-a373-4e8c-aabf-82fc76318140", "hitokoto": "我们没有相见，却是此刻最好的相聚。", "type": "f", "from": "日食记", "from_who": null, "creator": "Little_Qiu", "creator_uid": 1032, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1583510225", "length": 17}, {"id": 5231, "uuid": "be0ee57a-8d15-4e00-949b-c962e02b909e", "hitokoto": "犹豫就会败北，果断就会白给。", "type": "f", "from": "网友", "from_who": null, "creator": "187J3X1", "creator_uid": 4787, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1583626125", "length": 14}, {"id": 5240, "uuid": "934f0d85-c7b4-4979-bb44-4825ef1f9ef4", "hitokoto": "听闻远方有你，动身跋涉千里；我吹过你吹过的风，这算不算相拥。", "type": "f", "from": "抖音", "from_who": "暴走的芊芊吖", "creator": "Mint", "creator_uid": 5006, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1583812625", "length": 30}, {"id": 5247, "uuid": "c62cb2d5-ea8a-4608-8654-cb8b0ea4fd41", "hitokoto": "I like you, but just like you.", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "狂三游六花。", "creator_uid": 5315, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1583806352", "length": 30}, {"id": 5248, "uuid": "d7bbc3dd-9f5f-4d3f-979c-c40e5018a006", "hitokoto": "心不动，则不痛；爱不离，则不弃。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "狂三游六花。", "creator_uid": 5315, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1583809226", "length": 16}, {"id": 5252, "uuid": "8feabad3-35bc-4edc-8752-a35eae0617cd", "hitokoto": "死去的人不需要花。被花所拯救的是留下来的人。", "type": "f", "from": "bgm.tv", "from_who": "伪春菜", "creator": "Coral", "creator_uid": 5360, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1583940746", "length": 22}, {"id": 5275, "uuid": "686fca99-e420-47e2-b239-4e298ab47658", "hitokoto": "以前喜欢一个人，现在喜欢一个人。", "type": "f", "from": "QQ音乐热评", "from_who": "QQ音乐用户", "creator": "晚柠", "creator_uid": 5345, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1584175950", "length": 16}, {"id": 5278, "uuid": "ab51f840-5453-495a-8398-5da8b1e9d3f9", "hitokoto": "我特别喜欢“您”这个字，因为它的意思是，心上有你。", "type": "f", "from": "知乎", "from_who": null, "creator": "宋锦瑟", "creator_uid": 5194, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1584263642", "length": 25}, {"id": 5378, "uuid": "551b63a6-8ab8-4e8e-b2ea-9e5e4425df2f", "hitokoto": "脑子是个好东西，打从娘胎它就开始运转，但进了国会它就不运转了。", "type": "f", "from": "美国共和党国会议员", "from_who": null, "creator": "admin", "creator_uid": 3800, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1585050437", "length": 31}, {"id": 5386, "uuid": "84ece63a-e7e1-4f89-b8f9-eddadbdfdb1e", "hitokoto": "不要在晚上做出任何决定。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": null, "creator": "lzt", "creator_uid": 5623, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1585139757", "length": 12}, {"id": 5398, "uuid": "aae28604-5146-414d-9ef8-64d25e9459e4", "hitokoto": "因为无能为力，所以顺其自然。因为心无所恃，所以随遇而安。", "type": "f", "from": "未知", "from_who": "未知", "creator": "ash", "creator_uid": 5670, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1585366410", "length": 28}, {"id": 5408, "uuid": "9357e70b-7c00-4d7f-9d60-85c5c2da906c", "hitokoto": "机场永远等不到船，就像我永远等不到你。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "某网友", "creator": "小新", "creator_uid": 5703, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1585607330", "length": 19}, {"id": 5413, "uuid": "901a3a77-e851-47cc-8978-80e156ec58b0", "hitokoto": "用柔软的面点，对抗这个坚硬的世界吧。", "type": "f", "from": "日食记", "from_who": null, "creator": "Little_Qiu", "creator_uid": 1032, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1585759455", "length": 18}, {"id": 5418, "uuid": "15975da5-b1a3-4f58-8d6b-554cc2c42c37", "hitokoto": "人生就像爬楼梯，只有脚踏实地的向上，才能到达屋顶。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "hkaren", "creator_uid": 5713, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1585647188", "length": 25}, {"id": 5419, "uuid": "0c804669-06c4-4d5b-b151-44901b56c206", "hitokoto": "黎明之前总有一段时间特别黑。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "Soiltary、K", "creator_uid": 3915, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1585672946", "length": 14}, {"id": 5430, "uuid": "206c7881-a44b-4b9b-bf5b-511cd9b3a299", "hitokoto": "当眼泪流下来，才知道，分开也是另一种明白。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "何叶", "creator_uid": 5724, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1585669139", "length": 21}, {"id": 5434, "uuid": "9287fcc8-2c76-4ab1-bd18-55c6d0bbc7b4", "hitokoto": "小时候，奶奶说亲人去世以后会变成蝴蝶。奶奶去世之后，每当有蝴蝶飞到屋子里，我都会关上窗。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "molamola", "creator_uid": 5761, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1585851293", "length": 44}, {"id": 5438, "uuid": "e5b9b9f2-ad14-4b4e-b8d2-38d8e8796cd7", "hitokoto": "青春是一场不会回头的风，它呼啸而来呼啸而去，最终离我们远去，一点不剩。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "何叶", "creator_uid": 5724, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1586056301", "length": 35}, {"id": 5440, "uuid": "d254cbfe-7b49-4f7b-b053-2f0b9a874d99", "hitokoto": "人的伟大之处是在于面对困难的时候还能摆出崇高的姿态。", "type": "f", "from": "超级教师", "from_who": null, "creator": "雨啸青锋", "creator_uid": 5808, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1586142672", "length": 26}, {"id": 5494, "uuid": "c7646d86-6dba-45c7-a4fa-45c8aa78a659", "hitokoto": "你是我羽翼下的风。", "type": "f", "from": "Siri", "from_who": null, "creator": "sjfhsjfh", "creator_uid": 4997, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1586157037", "length": 9}, {"id": 5980, "uuid": "66e8ac5d-680e-4a74-b6ab-4d517b83011b", "hitokoto": "你站在高处，就少往下看。", "type": "f", "from": "b站评论", "from_who": "rgo142", "creator": "Irony", "creator_uid": 4464, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1588164388", "length": 12}, {"id": 5987, "uuid": "59f8b7f0-c967-4823-8ccb-a11cadde25c9", "hitokoto": "总会有那么一天，放下如今的执着和不舍，带着稍许的遗憾，去开始过没有那个人的新生活。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "网络", "creator": "契约", "creator_uid": 5584, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1586341573", "length": 41}, {"id": 5988, "uuid": "749f7393-79db-41d8-893c-cc8b8e66bacd", "hitokoto": "春天适合努力和拥抱。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "网络", "creator": "契约", "creator_uid": 5584, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1586341605", "length": 10}, {"id": 5989, "uuid": "276a8f6b-326a-4e66-80a7-46b307951525", "hitokoto": "把温柔和心软留给值得的人。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "网络", "creator": "契约", "creator_uid": 5584, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1586341691", "length": 13}, {"id": 5990, "uuid": "10482b23-bc16-4640-ac66-c6e94f666567", "hitokoto": "你逆光而来，配得上世间所有的美好。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "网络", "creator": "契约", "creator_uid": 5584, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1586341705", "length": 17}, {"id": 5991, "uuid": "5f6a0632-76b8-489e-b9c0-b34257842be2", "hitokoto": "我从他的生命里消失，而他依然闪亮。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "网络", "creator": "契约", "creator_uid": 5584, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1586341723", "length": 17}, {"id": 5992, "uuid": "71d28741-11f6-4787-8c9d-ac8035e34a3c", "hitokoto": "你搅散一池星光成为我的月亮。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "网络", "creator": "契约", "creator_uid": 5584, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1586341795", "length": 14}, {"id": 5993, "uuid": "87ebe748-cb98-4080-9631-56307c1b0021", "hitokoto": "他会找到别的月光，你也会拥有你的月亮。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "网络", "creator": "契约", "creator_uid": 5584, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1586341876", "length": 19}, {"id": 5994, "uuid": "7e6e8b78-56ac-47fb-ad2b-d32a30a8c994", "hitokoto": "能不能停下来，看看那个满眼泪花奔向你的我。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "网络", "creator": "契约", "creator_uid": 5584, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1586341893", "length": 21}, {"id": 5995, "uuid": "de49ff90-2d84-43c2-9248-bbf012c2a1be", "hitokoto": "事已至此，幸而夜风对他温柔。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "网络", "creator": "契约", "creator_uid": 5584, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1586341911", "length": 14}, {"id": 5996, "uuid": "ada40601-5a04-467a-8519-6a85a5e76c90", "hitokoto": "就算终有一散也别辜负相遇。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "网络", "creator": "契约", "creator_uid": 5584, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1586341932", "length": 13}, {"id": 5997, "uuid": "fe21d1c0-4739-4b8d-b929-0fab7aaa4b98", "hitokoto": "你依然让我觉得美好且心动，但我已经没有力气和勇气再去拥抱。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "网络", "creator": "契约", "creator_uid": 5584, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1586341969", "length": 29}, {"id": 5998, "uuid": "04afa579-e9a9-4905-9834-cf08d824cc49", "hitokoto": "你要储蓄你的可爱眷顾你的善良，变得勇敢，当这个世界越来越坏时只希望你能越来越好。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "网络", "creator": "契约", "creator_uid": 5584, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1586342079", "length": 40}, {"id": 5999, "uuid": "15b14ba9-2711-4414-8b20-88d0c453d432", "hitokoto": "今日过后，所有晦暗都留给过往，凛冬散尽，星河长明。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "网络", "creator": "契约", "creator_uid": 5584, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1586342145", "length": 25}, {"id": 6002, "uuid": "eb85cee0-61ba-42b5-b47a-3f64e15113eb", "hitokoto": "为众人抱薪者，不可使其冻毙于风雪。为自由开道者，不可令其困厄于荆棘。", "type": "f", "from": "微博", "from_who": "慕容雪村", "creator": "机智的狐狸菌", "creator_uid": 5198, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1586479818", "length": 34}, {"id": 6018, "uuid": "fc01370f-ef1c-45f5-ac74-efd84ab2e557", "hitokoto": "过去已成过去，将来还是将来，而我们能改变的只有现在。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "网友", "creator": "005", "creator_uid": 4640, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1586650226", "length": 26}, {"id": 6033, "uuid": "9f8e468c-0068-4469-bca3-5a86b5d1b934", "hitokoto": "假如，生活欺骗了你。你不要难过，不要悲伤。因为，它不止一次欺骗了你。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "旋风", "creator_uid": 5913, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1587043684", "length": 34}, {"id": 6037, "uuid": "1880f080-b1cf-4ee2-a86d-d0cd84bf8577", "hitokoto": "愿你的青春如花般绽放。", "type": "f", "from": "QQ空间", "from_who": null, "creator": "陌人犹未归", "creator_uid": 5933, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1587105044", "length": 11}, {"id": 6038, "uuid": "6d5ff9e6-87a4-4a83-81cc-13751c0482f2", "hitokoto": "梦想还是要有的，万一见鬼了呢？", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "qwqbear", "creator_uid": 3516, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1587110305", "length": 15}, {"id": 6085, "uuid": "677a3dcc-90f3-4b04-95b2-d65652b8bcd6", "hitokoto": "路为纸，地成册，行做笔，心当墨。", "type": "f", "from": "CCTV9", "from_who": null, "creator": "司徒和丞相", "creator_uid": 4434, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1588301055", "length": 16}, {"id": 6090, "uuid": "1f36491c-ebe5-4ef0-b94e-80138696a49d", "hitokoto": "你所见即是我，好与坏我都不反驳。我所爱即使你，好与坏我都能接受。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "xiaoz", "creator_uid": 6104, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1588496980", "length": 32}, {"id": 6101, "uuid": "0d4c4f83-095b-4701-a115-e3658b1494b9", "hitokoto": "从前总说，海底月是天上月，眼前人是以上人。后来懂得，海底月捞不起，心上人不可及。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "网络", "creator": "xiaoz", "creator_uid": 6104, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1588497100", "length": 40}, {"id": 6127, "uuid": "41d4be02-6c9e-40bc-a02e-a9badb622a11", "hitokoto": "没什么做起来是容易的，但只要你还能呼吸，离梦想实现永远只差那么一口气。让你的每一次呼吸都能够起效。", "type": "f", "from": "健身圈", "from_who": "Kai Greene", "creator": "Liak", "creator_uid": 6141, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1588761307", "length": 49}, {"id": 6135, "uuid": "a5faf166-4696-4345-838c-579a2059438e", "hitokoto": "你知道什么叫幸福嘛？幸福就是拍拍手。", "type": "f", "from": "哔哩哔哩", "from_who": "我是皮皮参", "creator": "皮皮参", "creator_uid": 6402, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1591426396", "length": 18}, {"id": 6139, "uuid": "29506e97-85a5-4df8-bffa-346987ff9d88", "hitokoto": "我拯救了全世界，全世界却抛弃了我。", "type": "f", "from": "哔哩哔哩", "from_who": null, "creator": "皮皮参", "creator_uid": 6402, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1591426015", "length": 17}, {"id": 6147, "uuid": "9541ecf7-9215-4bbc-89be-f12f12caecf3", "hitokoto": "Can you paint with the colors of the wind?", "type": "f", "from": "Pocahontas - Colors of the Wind", "from_who": "Pocahontas", "creator": "foreversama", "creator_uid": 3576, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1589112273", "length": 42}, {"id": 6162, "uuid": "4f3f0bd8-822a-4d4a-ac4f-bcdb89a71b65", "hitokoto": "经典之所以称之为经典，因为它能经得起时间的考验。", "type": "f", "from": "哔哩哔哩", "from_who": null, "creator": "砂水c", "creator_uid": 6215, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1589455340", "length": 24}, {"id": 6171, "uuid": "701002a7-03bc-4b0b-ac62-4de37a3286de", "hitokoto": "别丧了，说不定你也是别人心中偷偷藏起来的光。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "一个可爱的人吧", "creator": "XrCuWa", "creator_uid": 6239, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1589873287", "length": 22}, {"id": 6174, "uuid": "f6b14e22-5408-4bf5-9cd4-28e6044b6bab", "hitokoto": "每一次选择，都要为其承担后果。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "酷儿", "creator_uid": 6, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1589905867", "length": 15}, {"id": 6214, "uuid": "df95e3f6-7603-4085-ad8f-17e7e57c7b60", "hitokoto": "改革不停顿，开放不止步。", "type": "f", "from": "习近平总书记改革开放金句", "from_who": "习近平", "creator": "LemonPig", "creator_uid": 6267, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1590580002", "length": 12}, {"id": 6239, "uuid": "cd82be88-5cd9-4042-8539-ea9b5bbaa21c", "hitokoto": "只要我足够穷，就没有什么能够诱惑我。", "type": "f", "from": "原创", "from_who": "陈树凤", "creator": "陈树凤", "creator_uid": 5678, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1591290238", "length": 18}, {"id": 6241, "uuid": "ba136d4c-b6f3-4bd1-a09f-e6fba629c639", "hitokoto": "因为和这个人在一起太开心了，所以之后做什么事都只想跟他在一起，这就是爱情。", "type": "f", "from": "微博", "from_who": "一口一个玛丽酥", "creator": "Little_Qiu", "creator_uid": 1032, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1591200592", "length": 37}, {"id": 6242, "uuid": "b425ad6f-e30d-49d6-907f-44d6bd46d9d6", "hitokoto": "生活中寻找文艺的过程也是一种文艺。", "type": "f", "from": "网友", "from_who": null, "creator": "佩刀写词", "creator_uid": 6368, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1591161544", "length": 17}, {"id": 6251, "uuid": "2fb44aae-b7c3-4c33-bf5a-cc30cd37c9ad", "hitokoto": "你凭什么喜欢我，就凭你眼光好吗？", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "naruto", "creator_uid": 6347, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1590972937", "length": 16}, {"id": 6260, "uuid": "a60ccdf8-48fa-42af-813d-b59a99f7fab1", "hitokoto": "你没有半夜可以陪你打电话的人，你的情绪就像食物，都是靠自己消化的。", "type": "f", "from": "微博", "from_who": null, "creator": "Irony", "creator_uid": 4464, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1592125861", "length": 33}, {"id": 6261, "uuid": "79304228-88d4-49b5-ab4e-1e08b1a30aa1", "hitokoto": "爱才应该是刺中好人的唯一的剑，是恶人能佩上的唯一的花。", "type": "f", "from": "微博", "from_who": null, "creator": "Irony", "creator_uid": 4464, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1592125733", "length": 27}, {"id": 6262, "uuid": "64265537-b0f0-4aec-9523-ed1a3a26c416", "hitokoto": "“不要放手”，他们彼此搂着对方，在令人晕眩的旋转中，化作了记忆的露珠。", "type": "f", "from": "Bilibili", "from_who": "b站用户", "creator": "Irony", "creator_uid": 4464, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1592125312", "length": 35}, {"id": 6265, "uuid": "c3075f89-638c-4ab7-a663-6c9a1cb8faf5", "hitokoto": "人类期待某种技术的进步能够颠覆性地改善人类世界，但事实上，新的技术只是反过来再次强调了人类群体原生的缺陷。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "网络", "creator": "Irony", "creator_uid": 4464, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1592124932", "length": 53}, {"id": 6270, "uuid": "e274f893-119c-4a56-a121-a48b0fa4f588", "hitokoto": "生命是什么？生命是一个美好的巧合，是宇宙在奔向熵最大的死寂过程中，为自己创造的观众。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "Declan", "creator": "Declan", "creator_uid": 6466, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1592117482", "length": 42}, {"id": 6271, "uuid": "3f7a075c-8994-4698-81bb-eb4891bff69c", "hitokoto": "小时候哭着哭着就笑了，长大后笑着笑着就哭了。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "Declan", "creator": "Declan", "creator_uid": 6466, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1592113511", "length": 22}]